# Step-by-Step Guide: Deploying and Managing Next.js Projects on EasyPanel

---

## Introduction

Deploying Next.js applications for production often requires significant server configuration, environment management, and ongoing maintenance. **EasyPanel**, a modern web hosting control panel built atop Docker and Traefik, is designed to streamline these tasks for developers and DevOps engineers alike. By offering a robust, intuitive UI, seamless Git integration, automated SSL, and a host of supporting features, EasyPanel allows you to deploy, secure, and monitor your Next.js projects with minimal manual intervention. This detailed guide provides a comprehensive, step-by-step walkthrough for deploying Next.js applications with EasyPanel, covering every aspect from initial installation and repository integration to custom domain configuration, SSL management, CI/CD automation, optimization, and operational best practices.

