## Troubleshooting Common Deployment Issues

EasyPanel and Next.js are robust but you may encounter issues. Typical causes and resolutions include:

| Issue                                   | Likely Causes                            | Resolution                                      |
|------------------------------------------|------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------|
| Build fails in "npm run build"           | Missing/incorrect env variables, typos   | Verify `.env` in panel, check logs, lint code   |
| App not available on custom domain       | DNS not propagated, port misconfigured   | Check DNS records; ensure port 3000 matches     |
| SSL certificate fails to issue           | Port 80/443 blocked, incorrect DNS       | Open ports; double-check DNS records            |
| Static assets not loading                | Standalone build missing public/static   | Check Dockerfile/postbuild steps                |
| "500 error" after idle                   | DB connection pool min > 0               | Set DB pool min to 0 in app config              |
| Cannot access environment variables      | Variables not saved; no app restart      | Save in panel and redeploy service              |
| Docker build errors (M1/M2 Macs)         | Platform architecture mismatch           | Use `--platform linux/amd64` arg (if needed)    |

